# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with "
"quantum computing and want to learn how to write variational algorithms "
"using Qiskit Runtime primitives. It is also suitable for quantum computing "
"professionals who want to expand their knowledge and skills in the field of "
"variational algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay para sa mga taong may kaunting karanasan sa quantum "
"computing at gustong matuto kung paano magsulat ng mga variational algorithm"
" gamit ang Qiskit Runtime primitives. Angkop din ito para sa mga propesyonal"
" sa quantum computing na gustong palawakin ang kanilang kaalaman at "
"kasanayan sa larangan ng mga variational algorithm.\n"

