# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Variational algorithm design, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the "
"lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by "
"Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makuha ang iyong badge para sa Variational algorithm design, kumuha ng "
"pagsusulit sa IBM&reg; Training. Ang pagsusulit na ito ay inilaan para gawin"
" pagkatapos basahin ang mga aralin sa kursong ito. Pagkatapos mong maipasa "
"ang pagsusulit, aabisuhan ka ng Credly na nakakuha ka na ng badge.\n"

